{
  "statement_html": "<div class=\"wims_instruction\"><ul class=\"wims_nopuce\"><li><img style=\"float:left;width:20px;height:20px;\" src=\"/api/static/gifs/calculator_not.svg\" alt=\"Calculatrices interdites\" ><strong>La calculatrice n'est pas autorisée, ni le brouillon.</strong></li>\t<li><u>Aide à la saisie : </u>saisir 1.25 pour 1,25, saisir 3/4 pour \\(\\frac{3}{4}\\), saisir 2^3 pour \\(2^{3}\\) et saisir sqrt(3) pour \\(\\sqrt{ 3}\\).</li></ul></div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply1\">Question 1:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(3 \\times 0.1 =\\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1\" data-size=\"6\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply2\">Question 2:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(6 + \\frac{1}{4}={}\\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply2\" data-size=\"6\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply3\">Question 3:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Développe et simplifie : \\( (3 b  -1)(5 b +3)={} \\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply3\" data-size=\"10\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply4\">Question 4:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Ecriture décimale de \\(5+2 \\times 10^{-2}\\) :\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply4\" data-size=\"6\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply5\">Question 5:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Résoudre l'équation \\( 2\\)\\(x - 6 = 0\\). <br> Réponse :\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply5\" data-size=\"6\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply6\">Question 6:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(9\\) croissants coûtent \\(5,4\\)&euro;. Quel est le prix de \\(3\\) croissants &#63; <br>Réponse :\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply6\" data-size=\"6\"></span> &euro;\t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply7\">Question 7:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Une urne contient \\(3\\) boules noires et \\(6\\) boules blanches. On tire une boule au hasard. Quelle est la probabilité de tirer une boule noire ? <br>Réponse :\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply7\" data-size=\"6\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply8\">Question 8:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Calculer l'expression \\(x^{2} - 1\\) pour \\(x = -3\\) :\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply8\" data-size=\"6\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply9\">Question 9:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Moyenne des nombres : \\(13\\) &#59; \\(41\\) &#59; \\(7\\) et \\(39\\). Réponse :\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply9\" data-size=\"6\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply10\">Question 10:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(70 \\%\\) de \\(60\\) :\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply10\" data-size=\"6\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply11\">Question 11:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  La différence du triple de \\(-4\\) et de l'inverse de \\(\\frac{1}{7}\\) :\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply11\" data-size=\"6\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply12\">Question 12:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Un pantalon coute 80 &euro;. Quel est son prix après une baisse de 10 % &#63;\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply12\" data-size=\"6\"></span> &euro;\t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply13\">Question 13:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  L'écriture décimale de \\(25^4 \\times 4^4\\) :\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply13\" data-size=\"15\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply14\">Question 14:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  <table><tr><td><span class=\"pax-fig-group\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"230\" height=\"115\" viewBox=\"0 0 230 115\"><polygon points=\"86.25,15.68 172.50,15.68 172.50,96.18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><line x1=\"153.33\" y1=\"15.68\" x2=\"153.33\" y2=\"26.14\" stroke=\"#000000\" st